{"id": "EUVD-2026-60478", "enisaUuid": "c24c3265-7dc2-3145-899d-8159ab5c3456", "description": "This vulnerability only affects Grafana stacks configured with multiple organizations; single-organization deployments are not impacted. In a multi-organization stack, a user who is an Org Admin of a single organization can call GET /api/access-control/users/permissions/search?actionPrefix=dashboards: and receive permission data belonging to other organizations. The disclosed data is limited to dashboard and folder identifiers (UIDs) and per-user permission/scope mappings (which user holds which access on which dashboard). Dashboard contents, panels, query results, datasource credentials, secrets, and personal data are not exposed. This is a limited cross-organization information disclosure affecting multi-org deployments only.", "datePublished": "2026-08-17T21:28:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-14T10:16:35", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://grafana.com/security/security-advisories/cve-2026-11817"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-11817", "GHSA-72xj-fpfg-99ww"], "assigner": "GRAFANA", "epss": 0.35, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0afdaa74-5fc3-3425-ab44-e9f853023431", "product": {"name": "Grafana Enterprise", "vendor": {"name": "Grafana"}}, "product_version": "13.1.0 \u226413.1.0"}, {"id": "228ead22-0837-3757-aa6c-ab1e3bfa2f3c", "product": {"name": "Grafana Enterprise", "vendor": {"name": "Grafana"}}, "product_version": "12.3.0 \u226412.3.8"}, {"id": "5089659c-fa9d-3252-ad16-d6ffc9f7d200", "product": {"name": "Grafana OSS", "vendor": {"name": "Grafana"}}, "product_version": "13.0.0 \u226413.0.3"}, {"id": "6296316f-f4f7-34be-8e25-b9390ccd17f5", "product": {"name": "Grafana OSS", "vendor": {"name": "Grafana"}}, "product_version": "13.1.0 \u226413.1.0"}, {"id": "7822c842-838d-3dde-9c3d-065cd0baf3c6", "product": {"name": "Grafana Enterprise", "vendor": {"name": "Grafana"}}, 